steam/apps/541200/extras/a2f9ed308272ba60dd1575fad84ca412.webm?t=1774278487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541200/extras/a2f9ed308272ba60dd1575fad84ca412.mp4?t=1774278487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GTTOD is a fast paced FPS rogue-like with a heavy focus on fluidity of movement and high octane combat. Casting its net of inspirations wide, GTTOD captures both the feel of modern day movement shooters as well as the chaotic intensity of the best FPS games in the '90s. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541200/extras/5bb1537ed039bc13c590d2566aa58f75.poster.avif?t=1774278487\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541200/extras/5bb1537ed039bc13c590d2566aa58f75.webm?t=1774278487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541200/extras/5bb1537ed039bc13c590d2566aa58f75.mp4?t=1774278487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXTINGUISH THE HORDES OF THE SUMMIT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As one of the power-armor clad survivors in The Shatter, you'll be using your advanced mobility and a myriad of reclaimed firearms and equipment to outmaneuver and outgun the armies of a planet-destroying threat; The World Sentinel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541200/extras/f9bf5083a669edba653cfdde54132c36.poster.avif?t=1774278487\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://sha